{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35418844\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接分析STN-DBS电极位置及双侧不对称性与FOG疗效的关系，为解释刺激定位导致的FOG改善异质性提供临床证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35431262\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接评估STN-DBS对FOG的疗效，并通过结构连接分析识别与FOG改善或恶化相关的刺激通路，是理解STN及其网络活动与FOG关系的核心研究。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35441231\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接记录FOG期间的皮层PAC并考察STN-DBS对其调节作用，为解释STN与皮层网络协同参与FOG提供关键机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35456362\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"比较STN单靶与黑质联合STN刺激对PD难治性步态障碍的影响，可帮助判断黑质运动通路对STN刺激步态效应的贡献及其网络机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35652005\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统讨论PD患者DBS后步态障碍的神经生理基础、临床表型及程控策略，有助于解释FOG和步态疗效的临床异质性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35786442\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然研究帕金森病小鼠STN-DBS对运动相关STN活动的影响，但没有步态或FOG相关实验，无法建立与FOG的具体联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35848860\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"主题直接聚焦FOG的自适应DBS，属于理解FOG相关神经标志物及闭环刺激治疗策略的重要讨论。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35917720\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述PD-FOG的结构、功能连接及脑区激活证据，可提供STN以外的皮层-皮层下网络机制，并帮助解释不同研究结果的差异。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35976323\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述PD-DBS的总体临床应用及技术进展，对步态和轴性症状仅作概括性讨论，缺乏FOG特异性或STN神经活动证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:35979336\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究对象为多系统萎缩型帕金森综合征而非特发性PD，且重点是脊髓刺激联合治疗的个案，不能直接回答PD-FOG与STN活动的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:36069345\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究年龄和病程对STN-DBS总体疗效及轴性症状的影响，但没有独立FOG结局或STN神经活动指标。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:36110462\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述DBS手术、微电极记录及电极定位技术，虽然涉及STN振荡和步态相关靶点，但缺乏FOG特异性证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:36209243\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述主要关注LFP与运动迟缓、僵硬等症状及自适应DBS的关系，摘要未提供FOG或步态相关的STN生理标志物证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:36211167\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"题目直接报告STN-DBS后FOG显著恢复，提供与研究问题直接相关的临床观察证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:36270803\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"记录无步态障碍PD患者自然行走时的STN及皮层电活动，可建立正常步态周期中的STN神经活动基线，作为识别FOG相关异常活动的重要对照。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:36389071\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较伴与不伴FOG的PD患者皮层网络同步及PAC特征，为STN局部活动之外的皮层网络竞争性机制提供证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:36561025\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然涉及双任务和DBS频率参数对PD步态的影响，但未显示FOG特异性结局或STN神经活动证据，无法直接回答研究问题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:36575956\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要讨论中脑运动区细胞类型及一般运动控制，虽涉及PD运动障碍和其他疾病的冻结步态，但缺乏PD-FOG与STN之间的具体联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:36730026\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接通过人体术中单神经元记录研究步态及冻结期间的STN活动，并发现FOG期间β振荡增强，是回答STN神经活动与FOG关系的核心原始研究。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:36810199\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究STN非周期性LFP指数与帕金森病兴奋抑制平衡的关系，但没有步态或FOG相关分析，无法判断该生理指标与FOG的联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:36925563\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述PPN在步态控制、运动启动及PD冻结步态治疗中的作用，可提供STN以外脑干步行网络的机制证据和替代解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37092236\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较STN不同刺激频率对伴与不伴FOG患者下肢运动及皮层振荡的影响，可用于分析刺激参数、皮层活动和FOG之间的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37104542\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"计算模型研究多巴胺缺失后基底节β同步的形成机制，但没有涉及步态或FOG，无法证明其振荡机制与冻结步态存在关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37125563\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究STN-DBS对肢体运动迟缓序列效应的影响，实验任务为腕部重复运动而非步态或FOG，背景中提及冻结步态不足以构成直接证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:37182899\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述PD自适应DBS的通用实施流程及技术进展，摘要没有聚焦FOG特异性神经标志物或STN活动与FOG的关系。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "52126197-a271-4cfe-bf5d-f2b9e0c097d9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T134925603764Z", "elapsed_seconds": 211.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T13:52:57.035260+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ac3e3b68e46be32249d3fc5858c8edbdc3ba558ed055ffc466c4842fa6344b9c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T134925603764Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c1fc67cd5ccadd2226ec5d20d79f9e7fb4085081118f8c989b53f46aa880ccc5"}}}
